  "item_short_desc": "<p>Layer up and conquer the cold with Rothco&rsquo;s Heavyweight Thermal Knit Underwear Top. This thermal top is designed to provide powerful insulation, keeping you warm in the harshest of conditions. Constructed from a heavyweight raschel knit composition, the base layer top is built to maintain its shape and durability for years of use. The comfortable elastic ribbed knit cuffs ensure a seamless thermal seal between your top and gloves, locking in warmth and keeping out the cold.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
